"knockout-club-trailer-cover-2560x1440.png", "id": "1111505535025375", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908850587_1111505538358708_1555911906893755566_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Ye9DrP0pu4Q7kNvwHnnIz2&_nc_oc=Adp_tRe5CloKP5RaR-bM7cXtcNuiBXxFwscOky-vEb1wyxBNtmEyKoyL5TKbzNhgpic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXwUhnqmqyPlgVX9pDPb7dYELXdjRiJtLJLHExMQ0HJbQ&oe=6B106670"}, "display_name": "Knockout Club", "keywords": ["boxing", "mma", "fitness", "fighting", "kickboxing"], "long_description": "Three fight sports. Twelve fighters. Your fists.\n\nKnockout Club is a realistic single-player fight game. The game reads your real punches, so a lazy tap does nothing and a fast, square cross to the chin can put a man down. Keep your hands up, slip, duck and step back for real. When your opponent tires and his guard drops, make him pay.\n\nEach sport comes at you differently. Boxers trap you on the ropes with combinations. Muay Thai fighters throw round kicks, knees and push kicks. MMA fighters are wild and unpredictable, and they shoot in to pin you against the cage.\n\nEvery fight starts properly: the referee calls you in, you touch gloves, and your coach talks you through the rounds.\n\nFEATURES\n- Boxing, Muay Thai and MMA, all open from the start\n- Twelve original fighters, each with a style, a nickname and a signature move\n- Three ladders, three belts\n- Real punching: speed, aim and clean contact decide the damage\n- Real defence: block, slip, duck and step off\n- Throw your own kicks, knees and teeps in Muay Thai and MMA\n- No health bars: read your opponent as he tires, stumbles and goes down\n- Easy, Normal and Hard for every fight\n- A voiced referee, and a coach who teaches you the basics\n- A training gym, and workout numbers after every session\n- A profile for everyone who shares the headset\n- No artificial movement: you move with your body, in about 2 m x 2 m\n\nSingle-player. Touch controllers required. A real workout: clear your space and use wrist straps.\n{1159117549918944}\n{1669757821219480}\n{1912038619960020}\n{1886800612446220}", "short_description": "Put your real fists up. Boxing, Muay Thai and MMA in one game, with twelve original fighters and a belt to win in each sport. No attack buttons: how fast and how clean you really hit decides the damage. Block, slip and duck for real, read your opponent as he tires, and put him down. Warm up on the heavy bag in the gym and track every workout. Built for Meta Quest 3 and 3S."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nordlabsgaming.com/pages/knockout-club-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NordLabs", "support_website_url": "https://nordlabsgaming.com/pages/knockout-club", "website_url": "https://nordlabsgaming.com/pages/knockout-club", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1425164687355212"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835811_1123984710433276_5716373375499566139_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJjEprCviEsQ7kNvwHyXeli&_nc_oc=AdoCc6l9oe2twF-YqDSLWBftcJzzroeygnog4yxIX8dVJrG